Community Request for Derivative Works:
--------------------------------------
This project is built to expand an interconnected network of open-source
skills. If you create a derivative skill or fork this repository, we kindly
request that you contribute to this ecosystem by establishing a pingback or
linking your repository back to our main registry at:
https://github.com/andylockran/open-agentic-skills/blob/main/NETWORK.md

While this pingback is a voluntary community request and not a legal
obligation under the Apache License 2.0, your participation helps grow the
network for everyone. Thank you for your support!
